  "description": {
    "text": "The first Prerelease Kit, given to players at the Fates Collide prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 23–24 April and 30 April–1 May 2016; before it, prerelease players got six booster packs. Each kit held four Fates Collide booster packs and a 23-card pack built around one of four promos with the Fates Collide logo. The packs also held a non-holo Delphox, a card that is holofoil in booster packs.",
